# Jute living-area rug (issue 166): natural oat with a visible basket weave in putty, a plain darker tan border, no fringe. Seen from above like the floor: flat, ink outline, palette only, no print or text. 8x4 tiles. Lies on the floor under the furniture and the player.
size: 128x64
